WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.083
- Hehehe.

00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:03.208
- You really wanna do this, Teamy Bomber?

00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:06.875
- I'm coming for you in December...twice.

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:08.875
- Man, these anime outfits are very demeaning.

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:17.416
♪♪♪

00:00:22.208 --> 00:00:23.708
- You told me you'd forget to pass.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.833
- I’d explain myself, but this show’s like Cooper…

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.458
...one big Rush.

00:00:28.666 --> 00:00:30.875
I haven’t had the No. 1 seed since the year I got drafted...

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.250
- I was picked before you!

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:33.833
- Bro, everyone was picked before me.

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:34.875
- I'll show AHHHH!

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.833
Where's my cool falling soooong?

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:40.208
- I feel like I’m in the crosshairs…

00:00:40.583 --> 00:00:42.125
...of the woke anime mob.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.833
- Don’t tell me the playoffs already started.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:45.333
- You should keep your distance.

00:00:45.875 --> 00:00:47.583
- Thought you didn’t believe in distancing.

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:49.833
No, come on. We're in the bounty hunt!

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:51.583
Oh, thank you, little boy.

00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:53.541
- Yo, he's actually a baaad adult man.

00:00:53.666 --> 00:00:55.250
- It's ours, fam. Wait, woah.

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:57.958
- Micah could become a real member of the Cowboys! Ow!

00:00:58.125 --> 00:01:01.625
- That’s right. I, Odell Beckham, forced my way to the No. 1 seed.

00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:01.958
Come to—

00:01:01.958 --> 00:01:02.791
- Colt McCoy!

00:01:02.791 --> 00:01:05.458
- JUST WAIT TILL MY DAD VLOGS ABOUT YOU.

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:10.833
- A meaningless regular-season award? We're on it!

00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:16.541
- Just wait till 2017.

00:01:17.500 --> 00:01:20.583
Ok, I’m out and they won a Super Bowl, but imagine next year
when they DO have me—

00:01:21.291 --> 00:01:23.291
My decision making is SOUND. This will not happen—

00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:25.333
Alright fine, I’ll go to the Colts.

